::  modules/market/dimeroll/glow/fold-dimeroll-journal.glow -- ledger
/!  16384
|%
++  fold-dimeroll-entry
  |=  [debit-acct=@ud credit-acct=@ud amount=@ud]       ::  double-entry leg
  ^-  @ud                                               ::  conserved delta 0
  ~|  'dimeroll-zero-amount-refused'                    ::  positive units
  ?>  (gte amount 1)                                    ::  amount >= 1 MALA
  ~|  'dimeroll-same-account-refused'                   ::  distinct accounts
  ?<  =(debit-acct credit-acct)                         ::  debit != credit
  0
--
